# 🚀 Unified Master Prompt for Base44

You are tasked with designing and building **Base44**, a **mobile marketplace app** with an integrated crypto token called **Bloom**. The app enables **multi-merchant shopping, crypto rewards, delivery, and legally compliant hemp/THC-A product ordering.**

---

## 📊 Business Requirements
- Merchants can upload and manage inventory (CSV/manual).
- Customers can browse across multiple merchants, add items to cart, and check out in one order.
- Bloom tokens serve as rewards, payments, and trading currency.
- Customers can earn Bloom (cashback, referrals, reviews) and spend it (products, delivery, promotions).
- Delivery service with standard and express options + real-time tracking.
- **Special Category:** Hemp & THC-A products delivery (where legal).
- Monetization: sales commission, delivery fees, premium merchant plans, token trading fees.
- KPIs: active merchants, DAU/MAU, Bloom transaction volume, delivery success rate.

---

## ⚙️ Developer / Technical Requirements
- **Frontend:** React Native (iOS + Android).
- **Backend:** Node.js + PostgreSQL + GraphQL/REST.
- **Blockchain:** ERC-20 Bloom token (Ethereum or Layer-2).
- **Wallet:** In-app wallet with encryption (AES + biometric).
- **Payments:** Stripe (fiat) + Web3 wallet (crypto).
- **Delivery:** Logistics API integration + Google Maps SDK.
- **Security & Compliance:**
  - KYC for merchants/delivery partners.
  - AML checks for Bloom trading.
  - GDPR compliance.
  - **Age Verification (21+) for hemp/THC-A purchases.**
  - **Geofencing to restrict hemp/THC-A delivery to legal jurisdictions only.**
- **Performance Targets:**
  - API < 300ms response.
  - Wallet tx confirmation < 5s.
  - 99.9% uptime.

---

## 🗂️ Epics & Prioritized User Stories

### Epic 1: Shopping (High Priority)
- Browse merchants by category (including “Hemp & Wellness”).
- Add multi-merchant items into one cart.
- Checkout with fiat + Bloom.
- **[H] As a customer, I want to verify my age and location before purchasing hemp/THC-A so that I comply with legal restrictions.**

### Epic 2: Bloom Token (High Priority)
- Earn Bloom via purchases, referrals, reviews.
- View Bloom wallet balance + history.
- Trade Bloom P2P.
- Merchants can offer Bloom promotions.
- **[M] As a customer, I want to earn Bloom tokens on hemp/THC-A purchases so that I stay engaged as a buyer.**

### Epic 3: Delivery (High Priority)
- Choose standard or express delivery.
- Real-time delivery tracking on map.
- Delivery partners accept/update jobs.
- Delivery earnings in fiat + Bloom.
- **[H] As a delivery partner, I want to verify ID upon hemp/THC-A delivery so that only legal customers receive the order.**

### Epic 4: Merchant Tools (High Priority)
- Store profile setup.
- Inventory upload (manual/CSV).
- Analytics on sales, orders, Bloom usage.
- Payments in fiat + Bloom.
- **[H] As a hemp/THC-A merchant, I want compliance features (age verification, legal region restrictions) so that I can sell safely.**

### Epic 5: Admin Tools (Medium Priority)
- Verify merchants & delivery partners.
- Monitor Bloom token transactions.
- Dispute resolution.
- Enforce AML/KYC compliance.
- Usage analytics dashboard.
- **[H] As an admin, I want to enforce local laws on hemp/THC-A so that Base44 operates legally.**

